      "side": 1,
      "message": "patch_root isn\u0027t necessarily the path to the top-level repo, it\u0027s the path to the repo where the patch should be applied. The caller can specify it or the bot_update recipe code will determine it by matching the host and project of the change being applied to bits of configuration in the gclient config.",
